  "description": "After a lifetime of devotion to you, I refuse to be taken for granted any longer!\n\nSix years of patient waiting for my fiancé, Phillen, ended when he returned with a woman carrying his child. I now reside with her, feeling neglected as he showers her with attention. I'm left questioning my place in this household, facing a tough decision: stay or bid this place farewell.\n\n(Source: Manta)",
